{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While staying at the Ottoman Court, Vlad Tepes Dracula travels to slave markets, dungeons and prisons, recruiting skilled warriors to help him take the Wallachian throne. This is when he hears about a great warrior kept in the dungeons of Edirne. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that he defeated 70 fully armed soldiers while he himself was holding a dagger in each hand. He is a wild beast from Persia, descendant from an old tribe of warriors, mostly feared in those lands. People like him are trained in arms from small age, raised to stare straight into the face of death and charge forward, with no regard for pain or their own life. They are called Hashashin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gorgeous Classicvania game drawn in the NES/SNES style, inspired by NES classics like Castlevania I/III, Ninja Gaiden III, Shatterhand etc. Pick up your sword and fight your way through the gorgeous fortress of Edirne, descend into the darkest dungeons and claim the great Hashashin warrior for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But above all, see the world through the eyes of the legendary Vlad Tepes Dracula, discover the dark side of the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place before Episode 1, so you will discover some interesting connections both in terms of story and characters. It's all part of the big story. If you haven't seen Episode 1, check it out!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game by Tiberius</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2651830?t=1757096405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757096405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651830/996da51947ed5fb675a7f3d52788f55cdab3a9d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757096405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651830/996da51947ed5fb675a7f3d52788f55cdab3a9d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757096405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Medieval sword fighting with impalement as death animation."},"demos":[{"appid":3408090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While staying at the Ottoman Court, Vlad Tepes Dracula travels to slave markets, dungeons and prisons, recruiting skilled warriors to help him take the Wallachian throne. This is when he hears about a great warrior kept in the dungeons of Edirne. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that he defeated 70 fully armed soldiers while he himself was holding a dagger in each hand. He is a wild beast from Persia, descendant from an old tribe of warriors, mostly feared in those lands. People like him are trained in arms from small age, raised to stare straight into the face of death and charge forward, with no regard for pain or their own life. They are called Hashashin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gorgeous Classicvania game drawn in the NES/SNES style, inspired by NES classics like Castlevania I/III, Ninja Gaiden III, Shatterhand etc. Pick up your sword and fight your way through the gorgeous fortress of Edirne, descend into the darkest dungeons and claim the great Hashashin warrior for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But above all, see the world through the eyes of the legendary Vlad Tepes Dracula, discover the dark side of the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place before Episode 1, so you will discover some interesting connections both in terms of story and characters. It's all part of the big story. If you haven't seen Episode 1, check it out!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game by Tiberius</h2>","developers":["Tiberius"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651830/header.jpg?t=1757096405","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Copyright 2023 Tiberiu Ghinet. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 7 or better<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i3 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> intel iris 8th gen or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 450 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257082168,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082168/movie480.mp4?t=1757066855","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082168/movie_max.mp4?t=1757066855"},"name":"Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257082168/ed8d5c5f7320bf3d5ac65d06908df6973242d1c4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757066855","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082168/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757066855","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082168/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757066855"}}],"name":"Vlad Voievod Dracula: Dungeons of Edirne","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *